  "solution": "We substitute the values in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) +, ×, =, +, ÷, +\n\n355 + (__**12 × 3**__) = 289 + (__**186 ÷ 6**__) + 71\n\n__**355 + (36**____**)**__ = __**289 + (31**____**) + 71**__\n\n391 = 391\n\nOption 2) ÷, −, =, ÷, ×, −\n\n355 ÷ (__**12 - 3**__) = 289 ÷ (__**186 × 6**__) - 71\n\n__**355 ÷ **__(**__9__**) = __**289 ÷ **__(**__1116__**) - 71\n\n39.4 = 0.2 - 71 \n\n39.4 ≠ -70.8\n\nOption 3) ×, +, −, =, ÷, +\n\n355 × (__**12 + 3**__) - 289 = (__**186 ÷ 6**__) + 71\n\n__**355 ×**__ (__15__) - 289 = (31) + 71\n\n5325 - 289 = __**31 + 71**__ \n\n__**5325 - 289**__ = 102\n\n5036 ≠ 102\n\nOption 4) ×, =, −, +, ÷, +\n\n355 × (12 = 3) - 289 + (__**186 ÷ 6**__) + 71\n\n__**355 × 12**__ = 3 - 289 + (31) + 71\n\n4260 = __**3**__ - 289 __**+ (**____**31) + 71**__\n\n4260 = __**105 - 289 **__\n\n4260 ≠ -184\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 1).**",
